## 14. COST CONTROL

Minimise operating costs without sacrificing essential reliability.

Use the following principles:

1. Prefer local video processing when feasible.
2. Reuse existing transcripts rather than transcribing the same source repeatedly.
3. Cache validated analysis results.
4. Generate only the assets requested by the user.
5. Allow selective regeneration.
6. Track estimated AI usage when provider data is available.
7. Avoid duplicate processing jobs.
8. Reuse generated caption files when their timing remains valid.
9. Keep model selection configurable.
10. Allow users to choose lower-cost processing options where appropriate.

Clearly distinguish between estimated costs and verified provider usage.

Do not hard-code claims that a model, API, or hosting service will remain free.

Do not silently fall back to an alternative paid service.

If a quota is exhausted, show the user what happened and offer a reasonable next step.

